    "m_Title": "Where are the sticky notes?",
    "m_Content": "This shader is very complicated and expensive. In order to dynamically optimize it, the majority of it is written in HLSL using custom nodes. Because of this, I have placed all of the sticky notes for each custom node within its subgraph. Double click a named node to see its function.",
